# 3. PRODUCT VISION

Build one unified Android application that helps users discover and use six practical services through a common account, consistent interface, shared infrastructure, and reliable transaction experience.

The application should help users:

- Reduce avoidable expenditure and uncertainty when organising weddings.
- Obtain competitive quotations through collective buying.
- Access eligible products through trusted delivery arrangements.
- Exchange and reuse second-hand books.
- Discover and reserve compatible EV charging facilities.
- Buy and sell reusable surplus construction materials.

Although all six services belong to one ecosystem, each must retain its own business logic, domain-specific data, permissions, workflows, and transaction lifecycle.

The platform must support incremental development and commercial validation.

**Primary objective:** Establish a reliable foundation and launch one complete business workflow before activating the remaining services.

**Secondary objective:** Reuse proven platform capabilities so that subsequent services require less duplicated engineering.

