5. Both parties agree on price, terms, and delivery expectations.
6. Payment is processed through an approved workflow if enabled.
7. Purchase evidence is uploaded where required.
8. Fulfilment milestones are recorded.
9. Recipient confirms delivery.
10. Disputes and refunds are handled through documented policies.

