- Carry home.
- Create request.
- Eligible category selection.
- Route selection.
- Matching results.
- Traveller or delivery-partner profile.
- Offer details.
- Order confirmation.
- Fulfilment tracking.
- Evidence upload.
- Delivery confirmation.
- Cancellation.
- Dispute reporting.

## Business rules

- Prohibit illegal, restricted, counterfeit, or dangerous products.
- Verify participant identity proportionately.
- Protect identity documents.
- Record fulfilment terms.
- Provide transparent charges.
- Define loss, damage, cancellation, and non-delivery procedures.
- Do not claim delivery insurance without verified coverage.
- Provide reporting and suspension mechanisms.
