- Connector compatibility.
- Availability calendar.
- Slot selection.
- Booking summary.
- Booking confirmation.
- Access instructions.
- Booking history.
- Cancellation.
- Session record.
- Report a problem.

## Charger fields

- Owner.
- Charger make and model.
- Connector type.
- Supported vehicles.
- Charging capacity.
- Location.
- Operating hours.
- Available slots.
- Price structure.
- Access instructions.
- Verification status.
- Supported integration capabilities.

